     2| * IVX Wire Transfer API
     3| *
     4| * Serves wire instructions securely from environment variables (never from
     5| * frontend code or GitHub) and records incoming wire notifications from
     6| * investors and app users. Sends an SMS to the owner when a new wire is
     7| * reported so funds can be matched and credited.
